<%= if @releases != [] do %>
## Release observations

<%= line(@said) %>
<%= for release <- @releases do %>
### <%= line(release.name) %> <%= line(release.version) %>
<%= for note <- release.notes do %>
- <%= line(note.note) %> Noted <%= stamp(note.noted_at) %>.<%= if note.run_url, do: " [Source run](#{note.run_url})" %>
<% end %><% end %><% end %>
